 limp, shaking/heartbeat stop -> eyes close -> black -> restart + wake-up.\nOUTPUT VARIABLES (read them in your own events): JS_Phase (0 idle, 1 tension, 2 grabbed, 3 squeezed, 4 neck broken, 5 waking), JS_Snapped, JS_Active, JS_T, JS_Sq (0..1 squeeze), JS_Crush (0..1 pulse per squeeze), JS_Death, JS_Tension, JS_GameOver, JS_Error (count of runtime errors; effects auto-disable instead of freezing the game).\nQUALITY: Cfg_JS_Quality 0/1/2 (low/med/high). Cfg_JS_Safe=1 -> photosensitive-safe (flashes/glitch -70%, no black flicker). Cfg_JS_FlashScale / GlitchScale / ShakeScale (multipliers). Cfg_JS_Volume 0..1.5, Cfg_JS_SynthAudio=0 mutes the built-in synth. Cfg_JS_Debug=1 shows a debug overlay.\nTIMING: Cfg_JS_CatchDist, Cfg_JS_ScreamAt, Cfg_JS_SqStart, Cfg_JS_SqTime, Cfg_JS_NeckAt (must be < Cfg_JS_EndTime - 1.5), Cfg_JS_EndTime, Cfg_JS_WakeTime, Cfg_JS_AutoRestart.\nCAMERA: Cfg_JS_CamDist, Gap, FaceRatio, LiftHeight, FovEnd, FovKick, ScreamKick, Vertigo, Dutch, CamShake, Creep, SqFov, CrushShake, MinCamH (never below floor+MinCamH), NeckPitch/Roll/Yaw/Drop/Kick (limp-head pose).\nPARASITE: Cfg_JS_Parasite=0 disables; PA_Start, PA_Grow, PA_Radius, PA_Scale. Rendered on its own transparent WebGL canvas (never touches your 3D scene/camera/lights).\nSAFE BY DESIGN: the game canvas is never modified (no CSS filter/transform) so it cannot conflict with your own post-effects; Cfg_JS_CssFilter=1 (optional) blurs only what is behind the overlay. Optional: Cfg_JS_HideLayers (\"hand,HUD\"), Cfg_JS_Anim (monster animation name)."},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"SceneJustBegins"},"parameters":[""]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["Cfg_JS_Enabled","=","1"]},{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["Cfg_JS_CatchDist","=","130"]},{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["Cfg_JS_Gap","=","58"]},{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["Cfg_JS_CamDist","=","38"]},{"type":{"